<title>NETHERLANDS: GOUDSMIT BUYS BELGIAN EDORA.</title>
<headline>GOUDSMIT BUYS BELGIAN EDORA.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goudsmit NV said on Wednesday it had acquired Belgian Edora, a consultancy involved in the petrochemical industry.</p>
<p>Goudsmit said Edora was expected to contribute to the group's 1997 earnings per share.</p>
<p>Edora has annual turnover of 21 million guilders and the firm is profitable, Goudsmit said.</p>
<p>No financial details were disclosed on the deal.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
